script = ExtResource("1_7a2mi")
release_version = "v1.3.5 (CM37E)"
notes = "[TITLE] Items
Decided to buff a few underused items.
  Airplane Wings: 5% boost -> 10% boost
  Jamboree Pack will now stack with itself.
  Super Toon Cape: +5% Speed -> +10% Speed
  Bug-Eye Glasses: +15% Evasiveness -> +20% Evasiveness
  Groucho Glasses: Now gives +5% Evasiveness
  Heart Glasses: Now gives +3% Luck
  Monocle: Now gives +5% Evasiveness
  Baseball Cap: -7% Throw Heal -> -5% Throw Heal (at the cost of its rarity going from 2 Stars/Q3 to 3 Stars/Q4.)
  Big Weight Hat: Now gives +5% Defense
  Detective Hat: Now gives +3% Damage
  Fruit Hat: Now gives +3% Luck
  Party Hat: +3% Damage, +3 Max Laff -> +5% Damage, +5 Max Laff (At the cost of it's rarity going from 4 Stars/Q4 to 4 Stars/Q5)
  Princess Hat: -15% Speed -> -10% Speed
  Sombrero: Now gives +5% damage.
  Accessory Trunk: 2-4 Accessories -> 3-4 Accessories (At the cost of its rarity going from Four Stars/Q4 to Four Stars/Q5)
  Book of Laws: 4 Charges -> 3 Charges
  Goon Foot: 8 Seconds -> 10 Seconds
  Jellybean Jar: 2-5 Jellybeans -> 3-6 Jellybeans (At the cost of its rarity going from 2 Stars/Q1 to 2 Stars/Q2.)
  Propeller: 8 Seconds -> 10 Seconds
  Spinach Can: Now gives an additional +25% Crit Mult
  Toy Hammer: Reduces cog levels by 3 -> Reduces cog levels by 33%, rounded up.
  Unstoppable Gobstopper: 10 Seconds -> 15 Seconds
Fixed Mini Blinds leveling up your gags 100% of the time.
Angel Wings' rarity is now 5 Stars/Q6 instead of 5 Stars/Q5.
[TITLE] Misc.
Buffed the time score you gain per floor past 5 from 900 (15 Minutes) to 1200 (20 Minutes)"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d1j0hh6tsgy0r"
